{
  "name": "perf-creatures-idle",
  "description": "D-147 (user 2026-11-21 12:25: frame rate jumping, tiny freezes): 12 creatures (Boar / Neck) around the player, 60 s of frame times with the debug log on (the suite sets it). Measures; it does not judge yet.",
  "timeout": 120,
